<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Sponsorship Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { margin-top: 0; }
  .header-logo { float: left; }
  .header-title { float: right; text-align: right; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-row > div { flex: 1; }
  .form-label { font-weight: bold; display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .form-input-group { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
  .form-input-group > div { flex: 1; }
  .checkbox-group label { font-weight: normal; display: inline-block; margin-right: 15px; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%; margin-top: 30px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="width: 100px;">
    <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">1945-2020</div>
  </div>
  <div class="header-title">
    <div style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">October 9, 2021</div>
    <div style="font-size: 14pt;">75th Anniversary of the University of Houston</div>
    <div style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">Gerald D. Hines College of Architecture and Design</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">Arturo Chavez '90, Gala Chair | Remembering Gerald D. Hines</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">Honoring the Hines Family</div>
  </div>
  <div style="clear: both;"></div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">SPONSORSHIP OPPORTUNITIES</h2>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="section-title">DIAMOND SPONSOR</div>
      <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">{{ diamond_sponsor_amount }}</div>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>Two reserved tables of 12 in VIP area</li>
        <li>Invitations for 24 to the VIP Reception prior to the event</li>
        <li>Sponsor-named aspect of event (area within venue, bars, parking)</li>
        <li>Acknowledgement in event opening remarks</li>
        <li>Prominent placement in printed and digital media at the event</li>
        <li>Top placement in formal event invitation and digital collateral</li>
        <li>Recognition in media releases and news promoting the event</li>
        <li>Opportunity to host a private event, for up to 50 guests, at the Gerald D. Hines College of Design (sponsor is responsible for food and beverage, event rentals, parking, and security expenses)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="section-title">RUBY SPONSOR</div>
      <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">{{ ruby_sponsor_amount }}</div>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>Ten tickets for admission to the event</li>
        <li>Recognition in printed and digital media at the event</li>
        <li>Placement in formal event invitation and digital collateral</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="section-title">SAPPHIRE SPONSOR</div>
      <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">{{ sapphire_sponsor_amount }}</div>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>Eight tickets for admission to the event</li>
        <li>Recognition in printed and digital media at the event</li>
        <li>Placement in formal event invitation and digital collateral</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="section-title">PLATINUM SPONSOR</div>
      <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">{{ platinum_sponsor_amount }}</div>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>One reserved table of 12 in VIP area</li>
        <li>Invitations for 12 to the VIP Reception prior to the event</li>
        <li>Acknowledgement in event opening remarks</li>
        <li>Prominent placement in printed and digital media at the event</li>
        <li>Priority placement in formal event invitation and digital collateral</li>
        <li>Recognition in media releases and news promoting the event</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="section-title">PATRON COUPLE TICKETS</div>
      <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">{{ patron_couple_tickets_amount }}</div>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>Two tickets for admission to the event</li>
        <li>Recognition in printed and digital media at the event</li>
        <li>Placement in formal event invitation and digital collateral</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="section-title">SINGLE TICKET</div>
      <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">{{ single_ticket_amount }}</div>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>One ticket for admission to the event</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="section-title">GOLD SPONSOR</div>
      <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">{{ gold_sponsor_amount }}</div>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>One reserved table of 10 in VIP area</li>
        <li>Invitations for 10 to the VIP Reception prior to the event</li>
        <li>Acknowledgement in event opening remarks</li>
        <li>Prominent placement in printed and digital media at the event</li>
        <li>Priority placement in formal event invitation and digital collateral</li>
        <li>Recognition in media releases and news promoting the event</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="section-title">YOUNG ALUMNI TICKET</div>
      <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">{{ young_alumni_ticket_amount }}</div>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>One ticket for admission to the event</li>
        <li>UH Graduates 2011-2020</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <h3 style="text-align: center;">SHOW YOUR SUPPORT TODAY</h3>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 11pt;">For more information and to secure your sponsorship,</p>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 11pt;">contact <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span>, Director of Advancement, at <span data-field="contact_phone">{{ contact_phone }}</span>.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 9pt;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <p>UNIVERSITY OF HOUSTON | ARCHITECTURE AND DESIGN</p>
      <p>4200 Elgin Street, Room 122</p>
      <p>Houston, Texas 77204-4000</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
      <p>hines75@uh.edu</p>
      <p>713.743.2400</p>
      <p>uh.edu/architecture/hines75</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>